network-check-script = The proxy configuration script { $script } is not supported: the IDE cannot evaluate it, so it connects directly.
network-check-failed = Connection failed: { $reason }
network-check-url = Give an http or https address.
network-certificate-unreadable = Cannot read { $path }: { $error }
network-certificate-none = There is no certificate in { $path }.
network-certificate-unknown = There is no such certificate.
network-check-unusable = The manual proxy has no usable host name or port, so the IDE connects nowhere rather than directly. Correct it in Settings → HTTP Proxy.
network-agent-refused = Only a person changes how the IDE reaches the network or which certificates it trusts: Settings → HTTP Proxy and Server Certificates.
